at became something much bigger. That idea grew into Life Detection Technol=
ogies, a venture-backed MedTech company developing non-contact vital sign m=
onitoring for COPD patients. We built a clinical-grade solution, launched t=
he largest global COPD trial of its kind, secured 26+ patents, and are now =
advancing toward FDA clearance.

But what I am most proud of is this: LDT is on track to transform care for =
over 17 million Americans and their families. And it will do so while build=
ing lasting enterprise value.

I want to replicate that success.

Over the past 20+ years, I=E2=80=99ve been a founder, CEO, COO, and builder=
, leading startups through complexity, capital strategy, product developmen=
t, and scale. I=E2=80=99ve raised $10M+ in venture funding, engineered cost=
 reductions of 80%+, led multi-region M&amp;A, scaled regional AUM from $40=
0M to $3.2B, and helped organizations grow from scrappy ideas into acquisit=
ion-ready companies. My background spans healthtech, regulated tech, and fi=
nancial services, with a focus on doing more with less, and building teams =
that stick around to do meaningful work.

As a leader, I believe in clarity, trust, and shared ownership. I=E2=80=99v=
e built high-retention teams across startups by creating cultures where sma=
rt people feel empowered to solve hard problems, take risks, and grow. My a=
pproach blends servant leadership with strategic urgency, aligning people, =
purpose, and execution at every stage of growth.

Whether launching a new product, navigating regulatory hurdles, or scaling =
operations across markets, I lead with clarity, empathy, and execution. I b=
elieve in bold ideas grounded in systems that work.

If you're building something transformative, especially at the intersection=
 of technology, healthcare, and impact, I'd love to connect.

